    "fixture_shaped_logic_found": false,
    "unexplained_constants_found": false,
    "evidence": "The implementation diff centralizes grammar and adds AST fields. Its changed product paths contain no golden-data read, include_str!, checker-name, fixture-label, or test-specific branch. The failures come from the Java grammar/data-flow boundary, not fixture fitting."
