  "non_rejecting_residue": [
    "Java folds non-ASCII characters in SVG qualified-name metadata while Rust preserves the raw parsed code. This was observed in both families and was not counted as a rejection.",
    "Styling effects of valid retained note tags/stereotypes remain outside the command-recognition claim and were not used as findings."
  ],
  "required_follow_up": "Do not accept this mechanism. Port ColorParser recognition and failure semantics rather than #[^\\s]+; make Component endpoint parsing resolve the same named-note CODE domain as CommandFactoryNote/CommandLinkElement; and prevent Deployment from treating a rejected note declaration as a later ordinary endpoint. Rerun this preserved corpus with a new independent checker."
}
